<h3>90° / 45° elbows (ASME B16.9)</h3>
<p>SR (short radius) elbows — centre-to-face 1.0 × diameter — suit tight clearances. LR (long radius) elbows — 1.5 × diameter — suit free flow. The elbow changes piping direction and is also known as a quarter bend; typical duty connects hoses to valves, pressure pumps and deck drains.</p>
